CreditNoteApplication.description:
One allocation of credit-note value onto an invoice. The money move
itself is the paired invoice payment receipt (provider `credit_note`);
this row is the credit-side ledger.

ManifestClientWorkflowOverride.description:
One per-client workflow override row, verbatim. `state` is
`set` (value overrides the org default) or `disabled` (explicit deny);
an absent row means the client inherits and exports nothing.

delete.summary:
DELETE /api/boards/{id}/members/{user_id} — removes one membership;
the user falls back to org-governed access. Emits
`board.membership_removed`.

patch.summary:
PATCH /api/kb/articles/{id} — instant-first (IF1/IF2). Archived
articles refuse title/body edits until unarchived (typed conflict);
status flips stay legal.

get.summary:
GET /api/tickets/{id}/presence — current viewers/editors of the
ticket, TTL-pruned. The ticket must exist in the caller's org (RLS);
the roster is org-keyed, so it can never leak across orgs.
